	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De comiciis <placeName ref="l18">Augustanis</placeName>, utcunque procedant, non perinde sollic<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>itus angor amplius, posteaquam eorum gubernator facto testatur se iam de <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>religione adeoque contra religionem praeiudicasse, ut praeter impias <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>technas expectare nihil possimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Expulit enim ex <placeName ref="l619">Bavaria</placeName> <persName>Ferdinandus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ministros evangelii omnes atque edictis gravat suos syncerae pietatis, quam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sectam vocat, nomine.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Et iam per suos <placeName>Enisheimenses</placeName> etiam <persName>Rapoltzsteinium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vexat ob admissos quosdam <placeName>Lotharingos</placeName> exules pios auditum evangeli<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>i praeconium in aula sua atque praedagogiam christianam filiorum domini <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName ref="p8034">Heidegck</persName>, nepotem ipsius.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed dominus est, qui larvatam deteget hypocrisim <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>suoque confundet tempore.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Recte ergo fecerunt (meo iudicio) <placeName ref="l749">Saxoniae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>principes et <placeName ref="l572">Virtembergensis</placeName>, quod nec concilii decreta nec colloquii <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>deliberationem magnopere morari constituant, sed in agnit<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>a se<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mel <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>C<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hrist<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>i <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ver<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>itate c<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>onstan<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tes <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>s<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>e<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>se per<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>stat<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ur<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>os <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>eoque <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>nomine <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ex<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>tr<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ema lat<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>uro<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>s <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>profit<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>eantur<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Gallus furit in <persName>Troianos</persName> suos in <placeName ref="l2954">Campania</placeName>, ubi consiliarii <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>aliquot primaeque nobilitatis insignes viri haereseos condemnati sunt <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>ultimaque per supplicium expectatur executio.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dallosae item quatuor <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>studiosi iuris nobiles a familiari suo proditi, quod <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> libros <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>legerint, condemnati sunt, quos constat intrepide Christum confessos <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>et imprimis Parrhisiensem unum ex illis tam miranda alacritate et fortitudi<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>ne et dexteritate, ut monachis etiam ipsis aliisque stupori fuerint.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Et quia celebres illi fuerunt, tumultum excitavit reliquorum indignatio, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>qui minati sunt, si comburerentur commilitones fratres, effecturos, ut <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>una nocte omnia monasteria ipsaque forte tota civitas conflagraret <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>incendio.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Haec ex <placeName>Monspessulo</placeName> per literas proximis diebus significata <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>sunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Interea fertur 100 studiosos fuga dilapsos, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>plures in vincula coniectos forte ad tri<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>remes damnandos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> nostri actione apud <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> nondum audivi, <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>quae fuerit eius catastrophe; de qua si quid habes, rogo significes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z3"/>Aiunt collectam illic fieri <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensium</placeName> fratrum nomine in urbe et agro.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z4"/>Quod ut nostri imitarentur exemplum, facile, spero, impetraremus, modo <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>constaret, utrum id ipsis postulantibus fieret an proprio instinctu ex christiana <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>commiseratione institutum hoc a <placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName> esset.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sed et quid vestri <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>eo in negocio agant, non fuerit inutile rescire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Cęterum quod symbola <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>attinet, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, non puto tantam esse doctrinae diversitatem inter n<lb xml:id="p3z9"/>os quin possimus christianam in domino fraternitatem coniunctionemq<lb xml:id="p3z10"/>ue conservare.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Neque de te ego ministerioque tuo et ecclesia non candide <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>sentio et loquor.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Colo te ut virum dei, organum illustre et fratrem <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>venerandum sine fuco, sicut et <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName>, pios doctosque omnes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>quod impensius abhorreo ab hac controversia veniam dabis, quia <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>experimento didicisse mihi videor humanae feculentiae plurimum adferre, <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>ea occasione incitatis affectibus et scandalis perniciosis <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>campum aperiri.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quare vacationem ab ea milicia, si fieri queat, concedi mihi <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>postulo, in cęteris nec laborem nec periculum recusaturus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Sed <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, cum tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> 23. marcii anno 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te mei sym<lb xml:id="p3z19"/>mistae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z20"/>Viro praestantissimo d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p3z21"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino et symmistae colendissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
